{"reviewId": "6152799_8bhCugxjh", "review": {"type": 1, "bookId": "3300128305", "chapterUid": 6, "content": "牛鞭效应：\n一家便利店平时每天卖100瓶水。最近天气热了，销量变成每天卖110瓶。消费者真实需求只增加了10%。 但便利店老板担心断货，也觉得销量会继续增长，于是向经销商订120瓶。 \n\n经销商看到零售商订单明显增加，也担心厂家供货不足，便向厂家订了140瓶。\n\n 厂家看到经销商订单大增，以为市场需求正在爆发，于是安排生产180瓶。 \n\n结果就是：消费者的真实需求只是从100瓶增加到110瓶，传到厂家那里，却仿佛从100瓶增加到了180瓶。", "bookVersion": 0, "abstract": "牛鞭效应的基本含义是：当供应链上的各节点企业只根据来自其相邻的下级企业的需求信息进行生产或者供应决策时，需求信息的不真实性会沿着供应链逆流而上，产生逐级放大的现象", "range": "10871-10952", "chapterName": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "chapterIdx": 6, "reviewId": "6152799_8bhCugxjh", "userVid": 6152799, "topics": [], "createTime": 1786459469, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "3300128305", "format": "epub", "version": 1748903449, "soldout": 0, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://cdn.weread.qq.com/weread/cover/75/cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf/s_cpplatform_tpwzkagpzrvbkwwpe2swrf1735290012.jpg", "title": "人生财富靠康波", "author": "周金涛", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterTitle": "第一部分 涛动周期论", "author": {"userVid": 6152799, "name": "lym : )", "avatar": "https://wx.qlogo.cn/mmhead/iaHWOz8SnQVRUGLaGMkSZMdrxDSOY7CibZoHSGMIaScSK0nCciceUZfnvKKIgU6yoFsLFYCyLF04v4/0", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M9-0-5", "desc": "阅读神作", "title": "神作研习生", "levelIndex": 5}}, "isDislike": 0}, "likesCount": 63, "likes": [{"userVid": 203265017, "name": "水漉", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/IJwDFLRGLtSiaZlSdUS9G5ibTc9s1Och8ZRdl5FGWIHv9zxuaPhibqicr0TThV1iagUgr8bNghibolUUFvCft0IM594XQxY2176reSJerkn9LpVYc/132", "isFollowing": 0, "isFollower": 0, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 1, "nick": "水漉", "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": false, "deepVTitle": "", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M3-0-100", "desc": "阅读天数", "title": "阅读天数", "levelIndex": 100}}], "commentsCount": 4, "hotCom